msgstr "本次运行中此应用的客户端数"

# The strip box for the same figure uses its own word: sitting next to
# "客户端合计" (the bytes) a second "客户端数" reads as more of the same thing,
# where "设备数" is plainly a count of devices.  The table header keeps
# "客户端数", which is what its column actually holds.
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic/overview.js
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "设备数"

# The strip box that counts the applications the table is listing.  It is the
# same word the table's own column header uses ("Application name"), so the box
# and the column read as one thing, and "应用" rather than "应用数" because the
# caption is already the name of what is being counted - next to "设备数" and
# "周期" a second "数" suffix would read as more of the same.
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/traffic/overview.js
msgid "Apps"
msgstr "应用"

